ine/godot/pull/86776#issuecomment-3097342344)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nCloses: [godot-proposals#2358](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/2358)\r\n\r\n[Sample project 5](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/files/14546749/sample.zip)\r\n\r\n**TODO:**\r\n- [x] https://github.com/google/oboe/blob/main/docs/GettingStarted.md#obtaining-optimal-latency\r\n- [x] ~Get the correct number of frames per callback and for output.~ Went with the different idea.\r\n- [x] ~Get the correct number of frames per callback for input.~ Went with the different idea.\r\n- [x] Handle audio devices switching.\r\n- [x] Rewrite SCsub.\r\n- [x] ~Properly update device list after connecting or disconnecting devices.~ Went with the different idea.\r\n- [x] Delete not needed Oboe files.\r\n\r\n**Known Issues:**\r\n- [x] OpenSL not working. Tested on the virtual machine.\r\n- [x] Bad audio quality on machines with support only for in16_t format. ~Couldn't reproduce it on my phone.~ (My phone supports int32_t format, I just didn't know). Tested on the virtual machine.\r\n- [x] ~Audio not working on the physical device.~ An issue with my phone.\r\n- [x] Microphone not working.\r\n- [x] Connecting a new default device will be ignored if done outside the app.\r\n- [x] Stream closes outside the app and doesn't reopen if other stream started by the other app.\r\n\r\nSee [the comment](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/86776#issuecomment-1986911325) for the new TODO/TODO after merge list.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":57278199